  "_meta": {
    "title": "Clash Front canonical zone registry",
    "purpose": "Generator + sim input. The base pass reads biomeFamily/palettes/primaryElements (biome derives from zone+position); the seed pass reads family/strengthMultiplier/zoneAvgStrength (wild sizing). CF main session reads zoneId + zoneAvgStrength + family/multiplier.",
    "author": "Map-maker session, 2026-07-07",
    "grounding": "docs/maps/CONTINENT-TERRAIN-ATLAS.md (identity/biome/counts), docs/maps/ZONE-BIOME-SEEDING-GUIDANCE.md (materials), docs/maps/BIOME-RECRUITMENT-AND-ARMY.md (elements). Parcel counts + worldOffset are the real extracted data (data/hexagon-city-source).",
    "parcelIdEncoding": "6 + zoneCode(2) + parentIndex(4) + subIndex(4)  => zoneCode is chars[1..3] of a parcelId; look up zone by zoneCode.",
