        "SKY": "FIXED multiplier x2.0 — parallel airship-gated islands, uniform elevated tier",
        "UNDERWORLD": "RANGE by depth (x2.5 / x3.5 / x5.0) — sequential boss-gated descent",
        "SPECIAL": "prestige/curated islands (e.g. Founders Isle CGI) — ships no extracted parcels yet; combat role + geometry owner-TBD; baseline default"
      },
      "note": "zoneAvgStrength = baseline * strengthMultiplier. Relative index; the seed pass scales real wild-garrison size from it. Numbers are a grounded proposal — owner to tune, then freeze."
    },
